{title: Chhoo Lene Do Nazuk Hoton Ko}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Chhoo lene [G]do nazuk [Am]hothon ko
[Am]kuch aur nahi [G]hai jaam hai ye
[Am]Kudrat ne [G]jo hum [Am]ko bakhsha hai
[Am]wo sab se [G]haseen inaam hai ye
[Am]Choo lene [G]do nazuk [Am]honton ko
[Am]Sharma ke na [G]yuuhi kho dena
[Em]rangeen jawani [Am]ki ghariyan
[Am]Betaab dharakte [G]seenoo ka
[Am]armaan bhara [G]paigaam hai ye
[Am]Achhon ko [G]bura saabit karna
[Em]duniya ki [Am]purani aadat hai
[C]Iss may [G]ko mubarak [Am]cheez samajh
[Am]maana ke bahut [G]badnaam hai ye
